abstract: "A critical integrative review of low-power sensing materials, implemented distributed architectures, world-model learning, and the return of validated capabilities to heterogeneous endpoints. The review separates component results from whole-system feasibility and proposes falsifiable comparisons. No original hardware or model experiment is reported."
